      "created_at": "2018-03-19T13:21:38Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-03-19T13:21:38Z",
      "body": "While I would usually agree with you, every part of the analytics software is open source: Radarr and Piwiki itself. Also we don't collect any data pertaining to specific users. I specifically disabled ip logging to keep you guys as anonymous as possible. Additionally, you probably leave more data, with just a simple request to our or any other API server, since webservers log ip, user agent, request url, etc.",
